# Third-party apps already reviewed on this Mac (the macOS 27 snapshot).
# macconfig-check.sh prints an info line for a bundle id that appears in the
# usernoted store, is not com.apple.* or _SYSTEM_CENTER_*, and is in neither
# this file nor lib/notifications-off.list. That is how a newly appeared app
# gets flagged. Add the id here once you've decided to leave its notifications
# as they are. The Off list is only the seven apps in lib/notifications-off.list.
#
# One bundle id per line. Text after # is a comment. Blank lines and lines
# beginning with # are ignored.
#
# On is allowed for every id here. Do not move one to the Off list just
# because notifications are on. Company and MDM tools (Santa, SentinelAgent)
# stay here so the check never asks for them to be turned off. Kerberos, Find
# My, and Finder are com.apple.* ids, so they are ignored unless someone adds
# them to the Off list. Do not add them. WhatsApp Web is
# com.apple.Safari.WebApp.<uuid>. The UUID is not stored here, and com.apple.*
# is ignored, so it is not drift.

# Allow Notifications left on. Reviewed, so they are not info lines.
com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92 # Cursor
co.anysphere.cursor.nightly # Cursor Nightly
com.mitchellh.ghostty # Ghostty
com.google.Chrome # Chrome
com.google.Chrome.framework.AlertNotificationService # Chrome alerts
com.anysphere.sand # Grok Bot
org.hammerspoon.Hammerspoon # Hammerspoon (alert style is checked: manual step mode-hammerspoon-alerts)
com.microsoft.teams2 # Microsoft Teams
com.northpolesec.santa # Santa (company tool; never require off)
com.sentinelone.SentinelAgent # SentinelAgent (company tool; never require off)
com.tinyspeck.slackmacgap # Slack
com.spotify.client # Spotify
io.tailscale.ipn.macsys # Tailscale
us.zoom.xos # Zoom
# Reviewed earlier. Not required off, so on is allowed.
com.logi.cp-dev-mgr # Logi Options+
org.cogx.cog # Cog
com.openai.codex # ChatGPT
com.canonical.multipassGui # Multipass
com.yubico.yubioath # Yubico Authenticator
com.google.Chrome.app.cinhimbnkkaeohfgghhklpknlkffjgod # YouTube Music
com.sonos.macController2 # Sonos
com.anthropic.claudefordesktop # Claude
com.electron.dockerdesktop # Docker Desktop
com.raycast.macos # Raycast
